title: "Subspace Projection Methods for Image Feature Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Subspace projection methods (PCA, SPCA, SSPCA, Kernel PCA, Isomap) for visual
  classification. Structured Sparse PCA with co-clustering outperforms baselines
  on PASCAL VOC and Caltech benchmarks.
